# CVE-2026-33671: picomatch HIGH vulnerability (fixed in 4.0.4)
# Affected package: picomatch 4.0.3 bundled inside nvm's internal npm tooling at /root/.nvm/
# nvm is used solely to install Node.js for MCP tool execution; picomatch is part of npm's
# own dependency tree and is not reachable from the application's runtime code path.
# Risk: LOW for this application — no user-controlled input passes through this code path.
CVE-2026-33671
